  "units": "cm",
  "description": "Interactive 3D figure for what happens when light goes from one medium to another, book page 214, topic 8.2, next to চিত্র ৮.০২. A block of clear glass stands on a lab bench and a small torch in a clamp stand sends one narrow ray down onto its top face. Three taps, the camera going close each time: part of the light comes back into the air (প্রতিফলন, equal angles), part goes into the glass and bends (প্রতিসরণ, Snell exact, n = 1.5), and part ends at the surface between the two media (শোষণ, a warm mark). Then all three together, because they always happen at once. Five test questions on the picture. Offline, Bangla and English.",
